  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic swamps outside Subchain City, 'Gumbo' survived the early days eating mutated algae and scrounging for scraps. He learned early on that trust is a luxury, and the only way to thrive is with a sharp quill and a sharper wit.",
    "class": "Ronin",
    "name": "Gumbo",
    "personality": "Cynical: Gumbo sees the world through a lens of bitter experience and expects the worst from everyone. Pragmatic: He makes decisions based on what's most likely to keep him alive and swimming in DRIP, sentimentality be damned. Resourceful: Gumbo's talent for finding use out of discarded tech and weaponry has kept him alive when others starved.",
